Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(motion): split slow adaptive trochoid test targets

Move the shape checks into three independent test targets.
Keep the test count and quality assertions.
Use smaller fixtures and a coarser debug measurement grid.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2990
